Source: drouter
Section: audio
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Fred Gleason <fredg@paravelsystems.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12), autotools-dev, qt6-base-dev, switchyard6-dev
Standards-Version: 4.4.1

Package: drouter-common
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Dynamic router framework for Livewire
 Drouter is a dynamic router framework for controling a Livewire audio
 network, as well as other crosspoint router devices.

Package: drouter-server
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, drouter-common (=@VERSION@-1), drouter-python (= @VERSION@-1), mariadb-server, libqt6sql6-mysql
Description: Server components for the Drouter router framework.

Package: drouter-panels
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, drouter-common (=@VERSION@-1), firefox, lwmon
Description: GUI control panels for Drouter
 GUI control panels for Drouter.

Package: drouter-python
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3
Description: Python API for using state scripts with Drouter
 Python API for the Drouter framework. This allows creation of "state scripts"
 that can be used to provide automated responses to changes in the state
 of the Livewire network.

Package: drouter-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, drouter-common (=@VERSION@-1)
Description: Development components for the Drouter router framework.
 These are the library components and headers required to develop application
 for the Drouter router framework.
